  m_text: "\nThis diary entry reveals that Dalia was secretly following Omar. \nShe
    noted his movements from the jewelry shop to the train station and paid particular
    attention to the briefcase he carried. Her words suggest the briefcase contains
    something valuable, and that she believed it was worth tracking."
