  m_text: "Dear        ,\n\nMy mom is doing well for now. She's been visiting a new
    hospital, and the doctors there seem quite skilled. I\u2019m hopeful that with
    the right care, she\u2019ll finally start to improve.\nAs for the plan, I truly
    believe this is the right moment. His trip from Damascus to Madina gives us the
    space we need to move without drawing attention. We\u2019ve waited long enough.\_We
    should move ahead with it sooner rather than later, especially since my fake
    identity is now in place.\n\nYours, \n\n\n"
