      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Wa Alaikum Al Salaam, \n\nDear        , I have also gathered the necessary
    items for our secret thing. We should be able to do it once we reunite, I miss
    you dearly and I hope we getthe treasure that Omar once        from us before
    we reach            .\r\n\n\nYours, \n\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
